// QRWH01 only: remove the warehouse werewolf once Dar'kan has left for
// Thalantyr (QRD_ST reaches 3).  The previous script checked QRD_ST == 3
// and committed a removal flag even if the creature could not be removed.
// The successful quest ends at QRD_ST = 8, so a later return to QRWH01
// must be able to remove a creature retained in an older save.
// No guard based on the obsolete QRD_WH_REMOVED flag.
IF
  GlobalGT("QRD_ST","GLOBAL",2)
  Exists("QRVDARK")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    ActionOverride("QRVDARK",DestroySelf())
END
